isualization** of cerebral vasculature and aneurysm formations  \n- **Step-by-step guided learning flow** suitable for structured LMS curricula  \n- **Interactive XR environment** optimized for standalone headsets  \n- **Designed for training & education**, not diagnosis or treatment  \n- **High-performance and intuitive UX** for short or extended sessions  \n\n#### Use Cases\n- Medical and healthcare training programs  \n- Clinical awareness and anatomy education  \n- XR-based continuing education modules  \n- Simulation-supported learning environments  \n\nActive IR is ideal for organizations seeking to integrate **high-impact XR medical content** into their learning ecosystem, delivering complex neurological concepts in a clear, memorable, and immersive way.\n\n", "short_description": "Interactive VR module for understanding, visualizing, and responding to cerebral aneurysm scenarios in immersive environments."}]}, "developer_name": "Musa Kutlay Tun\u00e7", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://kutlaytunc.github.io/active-ir-privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Activate", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.activateholding.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "tr"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26332658246411920"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"stat